  "title": "Libya: TotalEnergies Announces the Restart of Production at the Mabruk Field",
  "summary": "Paris, March 12, 2026 – TotalEnergies announces the restart of production at the Mabruk oil field in Libya, in which the Company holds an interest of 37.5%. The Mabruk field is located onshore, in concession C17, around 130 km south of Sirte. Production from the field was stopped in 2015. The construction of a new […]",
